<title>UK: Belhaven Brewery maiden profits show rise.</title>
<headline>Belhaven Brewery maiden profits show rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.5		    vs 8.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.9		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.065		  vs 1.648</p>
<p> Turnover		  17.040		  vs 15.50</p>
<p> Operating profit	 2.525		  vs 2.309</p>
<p>NOTE - Scotland's Belhaven Brewery first set of results since flotation in July. Belhaven said it had seen continued competitive pressure on margins in drinks distribution but managed houses contined to perform encouragingly. Second half results will be heavily influenced by trading performance over Christmas.</p>
<p>Full company name - Belhaven Brewery Group Plc</p>
